────────────────────────────────────────
⚠️ “Does Feign have port issues?”

Feign itself does NOT invent port problems.
Issues come from URL / discovery configuration.

Correct style — service NAME, not host:port:

@FeignClient(name = "user-service")

Registry + LoadBalancer resolve IP/port.

Common real causes:
1. Hardcoded `@FeignClient(url = "http://localhost:8081")`
2. Service not registered / wrong name
3. Docker/K8s networking mismatch
4. Stale registry instance (LB hits dead node)

Interview line:
“Feign doesn’t cause port issues. Hardcoded URLs or misconfigured discovery/LB/container ports do.”


